DESCRIPTION:We’re backkkk!!! Can you believe it’s been 5 YEARS? Come h
 ave a big picnic with us ❤️🌈 MAY 30 2026 📍 Christie Pits 11-4PM 
 ‪The Pride Picnic started 5 years ago by a group of individuals who want
 ed to meet new people ahead of Pride as Toronto was emerging out of the pa
 ndemic.‬ The first year it was apparent that this is what the community 
 was looking for too! Since then\, we’ve intentionally kept it as a grass
 roots community meet up. No frills or events\, just a casual\, come as you
  are\, low pressure environment and opportunity to hang out and enjoy each
  others’ company This would not be possible without all of YOU that show
  up and keep the magic of the picnic alive We can’t wait to see you this
  year ❤️✨ If you have any questions please reach out to @beyondthebo
 ww as this account is not as actively monitored!! #pridepicnic #pridepicni
 ctoronto #pridemonth #2slgbtqia #pride ‍
LOCATION:Christie Pits Park\, 750 Bloor Street West
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/pride-picnic-5-year-anniversary
