BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Transient Radio: Launch Party
DTSTART:20260530T130000
DTEND:20260530T130000
UID:1c183a096fed0d2f075a588b4a004ce9@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:Standard Time welcomes Transient Radio to celebrate its launch
  as an emerging community radio station in the city. Transient Radio is an
  independent\, community-based online radio featuring mixes from DJs\, pro
 ducers\, and musicians worldwide. Dreamt up by Theysiii\, this project has
  been a long time coming\, sharing weekly mixes that connect Toronto&#x27\
 ;s music scene to the world. So far\, the radio has showcased mixes from t
 he likes of Nabihah Iqbal\, with the intention of platforming local and gl
 obal talent at all levels. This launch party brings together an afternoon-
 to-evening programming rooted in community building and open-format music 
 exploration\, featuring: Diverse musical programming\, ranging from vinyl\
 , live hardware\, and DJ sets by Olascanola\, faisalkon\, Erica (live)\, t
 heysiii b2b international habibi\, florasystem\, and critter A Vendor Mark
 etplace with booths from Queers for Palestine\, Disqo FM\, The Vermin Mag\
 , and Parallel Minds Label Food by RAKABI A chill zone with carpets\, floo
 r seating\, and games led by OFFFFFF THE RECORD Come through and be part o
 f a day built around community\, connection\, and the people shaping Toron
 to&#x27\;s music scene. ‍
LOCATION:Standard Time\, 165 Geary Avenue #2nd Floor Unit A
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/transient-radio-launch-party
X-SOURCE:YOHOMO
END:VEVENT
