BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:DAS MORTUARY: Industrial Goth Night feat. KASEY RIOT
DTSTART:20260530T230000
DTEND:20260530T230000
UID:c3f195ec832b1d458527b5fd29439b05@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:Welcome dark souls to DAS MORTUARY\, a cybergoth dungeon where
  Industrial &amp\; EBM beats command your corpse. Toronto goths and cybers
 tompers\, our next event is back on Sat May 30th at the Catacombs Cabaret\
 , a secret basement transformed into a biohazard dance cave with radioacti
 ve lighting\, pulsing beats and the darkest dance floor made for stomping 
 extra hard. Step down into our gothic dungeon and let your mortal coil dis
 solve through our toxic tonics and dark rhythms. Now happening every last 
