DESCRIPTION:New Sunnydale might be cancelled but our love for Buffy is ete
 rnal! Test your Buffyverse trivia. Come solo or in a team. It’s a BUFFY 
 THE VAMPIRE SLAYER TRIVIA NIGHT with DRAG! Featuring Lucy Flawless and Kur
 t C*mstain *** TICKETS INCLUDE ONE FREE DRINK! *** BRING A TEAM and test y
 our wits against other scooby gangs. or COME ALONE or in pairs and be matc
 hed up with friendly strangers on teams. 7pm - Doors 7:30pm - Drag! 7:45pm
  - First Round of Trivia! 8:30pm - Break! 8:45pm - More Drag! 9pm - Second
  Round of Trivia! 9:30pm - Big Screen Viewing of Dopplegangland (Free) 10:
 30pm - End TRIVIA - How it works You can either sign up as a COVEN or as S
 LAYER. A COVEN is just a fun way to say team. You bring your own COVEN\, u
 p to 6 people. A SLAYER is just a fun way to say you want us to put you in
  a group. SLAYERS will be put into teams of 4-6 with people they don’t k
 now. It’s a great way to make friends!(note: if like 2 or 3 people want 
 to play together but also want to meet new people\, sign up as SLAYERS and
  we will keep you together and add new people to your mix) There are two r
 ounds of Trivia. COVENS stay on the same team for the whole night. SLAYERS
  change teams and are in a new team for round 2. There will be cheesy priz
 es for the winning team of each round. DRAG - How it works It&#x27\;s Toro
 nto&#x27\;s most famous Buffy impersonator: Lucy Flawless And the guy who 
 will make your hellmouth quiver: Kurt C*mstain Bring your 5s and 10s to ti
 p your drag artists and show them some love. DOPPLEGANGLAND - How it works
  At 9:30pm we are going to open to the public and screen “Dopplegangland
 ” on a BIG 150 inch screen (yes - that is 7 feet high and 9 feet wide!).
  So invite your friends who couldn’t make trivia to come watch the episo
 de for free! TICKETS! Tickets are $16 per person and YOU GET A FREE DRINK 
 WITH YOUR TICKET! (alcoholic or sober). DRINKS AND FOOD We will be serving
  alcohol and sober drinks at this event. We will also have package snacks 
 (chips\, cookies\, etc) for you to munch on. You can bring in any food you
  want\, but not other drinks. And as a bonus: Everyone gets one free drink
  with your ticket purchase! ‍
