  HGTV and The Next Wave of Stand Up and Winnipeg Comedy Festival both stre
 aming on CBC Gem. Sam has also amassed over 70k followers on TikTok and ha
 s performed on festivals all over North America including Departure Festiv
 al\, JFL Vancouver\, JFL Toronto\, JFL Montreal and The Midwest Queer Come
 dy Festival. His writing has been featured in publications for CBC and Xtr
 a and he has been a guest on the Canadaland podcast. His script made it to
  the Pitch Competition Finals at the Austin Film Festival in 2023. We are 
 unbelievably lucky to have him join our Laugh It Forward show! Don&#x27\;t
  miss him\, early bird tickets are available now at the link in our bio on
  instagram! 🗓️: Thursday June 4\, 2026 🕐: 7:00 pm 📍: Society Cl
