UID:4c46c5ba688c22d0cec23fc6c4e92ff1@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:You&#x27\;re invited to Born To Be Alive: An Inkloosiv Voices 
 Pride Party! Join us for an evening of high energy\, uplifting gospel\, r&
 #x27\;n&#x27\;b\, and dance music that will have you singing your heart ou
 t. With an after party hosted by DJ Desiire and DJ Mira Mela\, come ready 
 to dance and celebrate pride the Inkloosiv Voices way. Inkloosiv Voices is
  Toronto&#x27\;s first queer-led\, inclusive gospel and r&#x27\;n&#x27\;b 
 choir. Inkloosiv Voices was founded by Jacen Duncan in 2020 and provides a
  creative home for artists of diverse racial backgrounds\, sexual orientat
 ions\, and gender identities to explore and improve their craft in an audi
 tioned setting that keeps the quality of music development extremely high.
  Our vision is to build a space for everybody to sing meaningful\, high-qu
 ality choral music in a space free from harmful barriers and prejudices. N
 ow more than ever\, Inkloosiv Voices values the importance of using song &
 amp\; harmony as a means of resistance against all forms of oppression. 
 ‍
LOCATION:The Concert Hall\, 888 Yonge St
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/born-to-be-alive-an-inkloosiv-voices-pride
