 y in full bloom. The event will also include a chance to meet this year’
 s Nuit Rose artists\, enjoy a silent art auction\, pick up some swag\, and
  support queer art and performance in Toronto. Event details: Sunday\, Jun
 e 7\, 2026 2:00 pm to 4:00 pm (Doors open at 1:30 PM) The 519 Ballroom\, T
 he 519 Church Street Community Centre 519 Church Street\, Toronto\, ON M4Y
