BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Freedom Party
DTSTART:20260611T183000
DTEND:20260611T183000
UID:15ede6acb052b43695a44d2e3e1ab363@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:Freedom Party Toronto\, Rainbow Railroad&#x27\;s annual kick-o
 ff to Pride season\, returns Thursday\, June 11th for a night of electrify
 ing queer celebration and solidarity! For over a decade\, our signature ev
 ent has brought Rainbow Railroad’s community together in Toronto for a n
 ight of thrilling performances and queer joy\, grounded in a celebration a
 nd acknowledgement of the freedom that we continue to fight for globally. 
 Join us at the Royal Ontario Museum for an unforgettable night where colle
 ctive energy translates into life-changing action as we raise critical fun
 ds to help at-risk LGBTQI+ individuals find safety and freedom. At this ye
 ar’s Freedom Party\, we will honour two decades of Rainbow Railroad’s 
 vital work\, supporting more than 40\,000 LGBTQI+ individuals. We’re cel
 ebrating a reunion our community has been waiting for: Priyanka\, Scarlett
  Bobo\, and Lemon will reunite on stage to celebrate the iconic Canada&#x2
 7\;s Drag Race episode featuring Rainbow Railroad. With amazing DJs\, excl
 usive VIP experiences\, and a stacked lineup of performers\, this is your 
 invitation to dance all night long. We are so grateful for the support of 
 our community here in Toronto\, who have made our work possible for the pa
 st two decades. We can’t wait to celebrate with you in person! Stay tune
 d for more huge talent announcements soon! ‍
LOCATION:ROM (Royal Ontario Museum)\, 100 Queens Park
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/freedom-party-3
X-SOURCE:YOHOMO
END:VEVENT
