UID:5a15982879e074d6f72017e7bbfbf83d@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:DJ #Gonzo DJ #Heccstasy Toronto\, the wait is finally over! 
 🌴✨ We know you’ve been starving for something real—not just anoth
 er night out\, but an authentic Latin heartbeat in the very center of the 
 city. 🇨🇴🔥 Introducing MambaBLACK: the inaugural edition of a move
 ment dedicated to the soul\, the heat\, and the unmistakable rhythm of Cal
 i\, Colombia. 🦜💃 Known as La Sucursal del Cielo (The Branch of Heave
 n)\, Cali’s spirit is defined by a passion for the dance floor that we a
 re bringing straight to the 6ix! 🥥☀️ From the timeless swing of Sal
 sa and Merengue to the high-energy pulse of Reggaeton\, Dancehall and Trib
 al House\, we are transforming the night into a tropical sanctuary. 🍍
 🥁 This is for the ones who crave the culture\, the ones who dance with 
 heart\, and the ones who have been looking for a piece of home in Toronto.
  🌺🍹 This isn’t just a party\; it’s a homecoming. Get ready to ex
 perience the &quot\;Branch of Heaven&quot\; right here in the North! 🇨
 🇴✨ ‍
LOCATION:Playa by TULUM\, 291 King Street W\, 2nd Floor.
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/mamba-black
X-SOURCE:YOHOMO
END:VEVENT
