DESCRIPTION:Pride-Chella\, a drag brunch with festival energy! Which headl
 iner will you be front row for? Starring Sucka\, Makayla Couture &amp\; Di
 vina Diefor Pride-Chella is taking over Granite Brewery\, where Toronto Pr
 ide meets full-on festival chaos\, complete with a stacked drag lineup and
  a brunch worth showing up for. Forget everything you know about brunch\; 
 this is main stage energy only. Come for the brunch\, stay for the chaos. 
 It’s Pride\, it’s messy\, and it’s giving headliner energy all after
 noon. 🌈✨ OUR LINEUP: Sucka Queen as Divina Diefor as Date &amp\; Time
 : Saturday\, June 13th | 12:00 PM Location: Granite Brewery (245 Eglinton 
 Ave E\, Toronto) Tickets: $15 Early Bird\, $20 GA Menu: A curated brunch b
 uffet featuring all your favourite items! The buffet includes coffee/tea\,
  salads and dessert! NOTE: Brunch is not included in your ticket price. A 
 $25 minimum spend is required\, and a 18% gratuity will be applied to all 
 bills Age Requirement: This show is 18+ Cast: Sucka Queen\, Divina Diefor\
 , and Makayla Couture (Canada&#x27\;s Drag Race) Get ready for a one-of-a-
 kind Drag Brunch Bingo experience at Granite Brewery! Expect high-energy d
 rag performances\, hilarious bingo rounds\, and fabulous prizes! Doors ope
 n at 11:30am! 🌟 What to Expect: ✨ Show-stopping drag performances fro
 m Sucka and others! 🎱 Bingo games with exciting prizes 💸 Please reme
 mber to bring cash to tip the queens! 🪑 Communal seating – purchase t
 ickets in groups to be seated together 🚗 Free parking on-site Gather yo
 ur friends\, showcase your pride\, and come ready to slay! ⚡️🎤🥂 
 Get your tickets now – seats fill up fast! ‍
LOCATION:Granite Brewery\, 245 Eglinton Avenue East
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/pride-chella-drag-bingo-brunch
X-SOURCE:YOHOMO
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Glad Day Lit’s Pride Month Artist Market (June 13)
DTSTART:20260613T120500
DTEND:20260613T120500
UID:c4baecb10aca7c65f108c50cded9cb83@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:A Saturday full of incredible artists! Support queer &amp\; tr
 ans art! FREE entry - get something special for yourself or someone you lo
 ve. One of many Pride Month artist markets at Glad Day Lit! Over 60 vendor
 s between June 6th &amp\; 13th! RSVP for the Eventbrite for the 13th while
  you&#x27\;re here and claim your chance to win a $25 credit to the market
 ! This is FREE to attend but if you RSVP you get entered into a draw to ge
 t $25 to spend at the market! Name will be drawn the night before the even
 t. One entry per person. Vendors: (For more vendor info check our instagra
 m @gladdaybookshop!) FAITHSKNITTEDFTNEGATIV0 Robin K Herman The Happy Yam 
 Spice Babies Eunice Lai House of Polari Anothertechnique Elliot Woods Aman
 da Makes Former Wasteland Mirror Path Collective Beadstore Cowboy COVEN by
  Sonia Kang Obscure Creations Ronanko Candi Craft Cherub Crater Atlas Do V
 ale hellafroot Bad Gutz cslackdesign Kat Bell vinemind Tyler The Cutie Art
 ist Fruity Frog Creations Cat Love The entrance\, washroom and space are w
 heelchair accessible. MOBILITY DEVICE ACCESSIBILITY : IMPORTANT ALTERNATIV
 E because of snow(this is a note for people in wheelchairs\, scooter\, wit
 h a walker or folks who cannot do more than 2 stairs) While our front door
  and the inside of the space is accessible\, some environmental factors (l
 ike snow) can impact the path to the front door through the park. So here 
 is the accessible alternative: You can access our front door by going thro
 ugh the condo next door. OPTION #1: 21 Abell St - Get dropped off or picke
 d up at 21 Abell and enter the condo from the east side. Go through the lo
 bby and then out the north (main) door\, you are then at Glad Day. OPTION 
 #2: Get dropped off at the parking garage behind 47 Abell / 16 Lisgar. Ent
 er the condo from the south side\, which is a covered driveway behind the 
 condo. You enter from the south\, you walk through the lobby and then out 
 the north (main) door\, you are then at Glad Day. This one can be trickyk 
 so the 21 Abell option is often more reliable. ‍
LOCATION:Glad Day (32 Lisgar)\, 32 Lisgar
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/glad-day-lits-pride-month-artist-market-ju
 ne-13
X-SOURCE:YOHOMO
END:VEVENT
