 and maybe even show off your competitive side. Mark your calendar for June
  16th! A portion of the ticket proceeds will support Get REAL&#x27\;s miss
 ion to combat 2SLGBTQ+ discrimination\, racism and bullying in schools and
  workplaces! ✨ What’s Happening: Exciting games and prizes throughout 
 the night Over 800 Board Games to choose from &amp\; Game Experts availabl
 e to help you learn the best games! Full Restaurant &amp\; Bar Menu: delic
 ious bites from our full kitchen and craft cocktails\, local draft beers\,
  classic bar rail favourites\, fun shots\, and more! A welcoming\, safe sp
 ace created by and for the 2SLGBTQIA+ community 🌈 Who’s It For? This 
 is an inclusive event centering 2SLGBTQIA+ folks. Allies are welcome\, but
  must be mindful and respectful that this space is intentionally queer-foc
 used. 💬 Community Guidelines: Kindness is key! We do not tolerate racis
 m\, transphobia\, queerphobia\, body shaming\, or any form of oppressive b
 ehaviour. We want you to feel safe\, seen\, and celebrated. 📌 What to B
 ring: Valid government-issued ID (19+ event) Your Eventbrite ticket/confir
 mation email A payment method for food\, drinks\, and merch 🗓️ Ticket
 s are refundable up to 24 hours before the event. Let’s play\, slay\, an
 d support the community together 💖 ‍
