UID:be38df4d424ce0e267165a72b01d35ea@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:Queer Collage Club is ready to celebrate Pride. 🌈✂️ Joi
 n us for a fun\, relaxed evening of creativity\, connection\, and collagin
 g! Inspired by this year’s Toronto Pride theme\, We Won’t Stop\, we in
 vite you to come together as a community to explore and creatively express
  what pride means to you. The night will include collaging\, group activit
 ies\, giveaways\, music\, signature drinks (available for purchase at the 
 bar)\, and community all evening long. All creative materials will be prov
 ided\, including magazines\, paper\, ribbons\, markers\, and much more. No
  experience required! There will be inspiration\, examples\, and gentle gu
 idance throughout the night. ✨ Plus\, capture the moment in real time wi
 th first-come\, first-served line drawing portraits available throughout t
 he event. 🖊️ Come solo\, bring a friend\, express yourself in a safe 
 space &lt\;3 📅 Wednesday\, June 17\, 2026 | 7:00–9:30 PM 📍 Three D
 ollar Bill\, 1592 Queen St W\, Toronto\, ON M6R 1A8 🎟️ Limited spots 
 available\, reserve yours now! Early Bird Bundle: $22.50 until June 3 at 1
 1:55 PM 💘 Bundle &amp\; Save: Buy 2+ tickets and save 10% on your entir
 e order All sales final. A portion of ticket sales will be donated to Frie
 nds of Ruby! Friends of Ruby is dedicated to the progressive well-being of
  2SLGBQTIA+ youth (aged 16-29) through mental health services\, social ser
 vices\, and housing. Their work helps create safer\, more affirming spaces
  where lesbian\, gay\, bisexual\, transgender\, queer\, intersex\, and two
 -spirit youth can access the care\, community\, and resources they deserve
 . We are proud to support their mission! ‍
