UID:e9b03e8adf64b7b4801a7fc3ef6607b5@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:Calling all Queer Brown Women\, Trans\, and Nonbinary folks in
  Toronto 📣 Our 5th annual Toronto picnic—and largest in-person event 
 of the year—is back! 🧺 🏖☀️ Join us on Saturday June 20th at no
 on for a potluck picnic on the beach. Location &amp\; potluck details will
  be emailed to those who register. *Begins at 12pm sharp\, as we will be t
 ravelling via ferry together. (You can leave at any time but we will wrap 
 up around 7) 🎟️Register at www.qsawnetwork.com/events (link in bio on
  Instagram under events tab) 🥪Entry fee is just a potluck item :) IMPOR
 TANT: *Registration closes June 15th *Check your junk/spam folders to ensu
 re you don’t miss our email *Add QSAWnetwork@gmail.com as a contact to e
 nsure you get our emails This is our fifth annual picnic in Toronto! We we
 lcome all South Asian\, Indo-Caribbean\, Indo-African\, and Fijian queer f
 olks. We hope to see you there 💞 Notes: • This is a community event r
 un by volunteers. We don’t have funding for it. We host at Hanlan’s as
  it is relatively secluded (to avoid being seen by aunties/uncles). But we
  understand the $10 ferry ticket can be financially difficult for some fol
 ks. If so\, please email us\, and we will try our best to accommodate you 
 (by putting out a call for donations). • IF you are able to donate $10 f
 or someone to attend\, please let us know ••• #pridetoronto #queer #
 queerdesi #queersouthasian #wlw ‍
LOCATION:Hanlan&#x27\;s Point Beach\, Toronto Islands
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/queer-desi-summer-picnic-2
X-SOURCE:YOHOMO
END:VEVENT
