UID:1828b1e9087c7c7842493e4b80cf1f82@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:We’re back for our annual BISEXUAL PRIDE PARTY and it’s go
 ing to be WILD. We’ll have pole performers\, burlesque\, drag\, tattoos\
 , 3 DJs\, photo moments\, projection installations\, and multiple rooms to
  explore! Oh\, and a wet t-shirt contest of course. PSA: This is our ONLY 
 BI BI BABY of the year\, so you don’t want to miss it. IMPORTANT INFO: B
 I BI BABY is a party celebrating bisexuality\, but we welcome all members 
 of the queer community and allies. QTBIPOC friends can use code QTBBB for 
 15% OFF their tickets. Attendants who require an accessibility assistant c
 an be provided with a complimentary caregiver ticket to the event. Please 
 contact hello@somethiiing.co should you require this ticket. This event is
  sponsored bi our pals at Tinder Canada DJs Grrrl Crush Trinidaddy Tangeri
 ne Performers Manny Dingo El Toro Tanya Cheex Makayla Couture Neno Freebir
 d Wrong Note Rusty Robin Banks Saint Installation Artist Connie Oreamuno P
 hotographers Digital Tee Quinton Cruikshanks Queer Pride 2026 June 5 – 2
 8\, 2026 WE’RE BACK DIVAS &lt\;3 It’s Queer Pride 2026 and Buddies and
  Buddies Nightlife are teaming up to make HERstory with our messiest\, mos
 t maximalist Pride yet. We’ve got a full month line-up of extremely quee
 r parties\, raves\, cabarets\, concerts\, and comedy. No matter what flavo
 ur you bring\, there’s room for you in our alphabet soup \;) Join us on 
 the biggest dance floor in the village for the best of queer culture in To
 ronto and beyond. Thank you to our Government Partner\, Canadian Heritage\
 , and our Gold Sponsor\, Freddie\, for making the 2026 Queer Pride Festiva
 l possible! ‍
