BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:INVT and Chinelo presented by body2body x Standard Time
DTSTART:20260620T220000
DTEND:20260620T220000
UID:5081d862bff4c9d99eb1b3c7ee1bf36d@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:body2body x Standard Time present INVT and Chinelo! We&#x27\;r
 e excited to welcome INVT back into our space alongside Chinelo on opening
  duties. Childhood best friends Luca Medici and Delbert Perez have been cr
 eating art together as INVT for almost a decade. Their project spans sound
  system music\, art\, and fashion. Before gaining international recognitio
 n and performing at major events like Circoloco\, Fabric\, Panorama Bar\, 
 and Boiler Room\, the Miami duo built a strong local community through the
 ir DJing\, live hardware sets\, and prolific output of music releases and 
 fashion collections. Their music blends electronic dance genres such as te
 chno\, UK bass\, and tribal house with Latin genres like cumbia and dembow
 . Reflecting Miami’s diverse culture and drawing from their Hispanic her
 itage\, their genre-blending productions ignite dancefloors around the wor
 ld. INVT’s clothing line features repurposed vintage items with embroide
 ring\, screen printing\, sewing\, and acid washing\, showcasing designs in
 spired by Miami’s nightlife and sexy\, tropical imagery. INVT has amasse
 d an impressive catalog of over 200 songs\, known for deep\, swinging drum
 s and trippy textures\, released at a rapid pace. They regularly tour the 
 globe and have gone b2b with renowned artists such as Skream\, Skee Mask\,
  DJ Python\, and more. Their drive and creativity have propelled their car
 eers while also shining a spotlight on other Miami talents\, making INVT a
  key force in the global electronic music scene. ‍
LOCATION:Standard Time\, 165 Geary Avenue #2nd Floor Unit A
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/invt-and-chinelo-presented-by-body2body-x-
 standard-time
X-SOURCE:YOHOMO
END:VEVENT
