BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Tarot for Grief and Crisis
DTSTART:20260623T190000
DTEND:20260623T190000
UID:da958d2a10391b20bead32523ad5435f@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:Facilitated by E\, Queer Death Salon has the purpose of buildi
 ng connection\, skill\, and resources for 2SLGBTQIA+ people. Participants 
 will be led through Jungian\, Hermetic\, and Rider-Waite tarot traditions 
 and what it means to read in different modalities\, especially in times of
  grief or crisis. We will explore the 7 Card Grief Spread by Emerald Lotus
 \, Death Tarot Spread by Tina Gong\, and a simple 3 Card Spread Paticipant
 s are encouraged to bring their own cards\, favourite spreads\, and questi
 ons E (she/her/they/them)\, is a largely self-taught tarot reader of about
  17 years. They primarily approach their reads from a Jungian or Archetypa
 l standpoint\, inviting people to explore the cards from a deeper psycholo
 gical standpoint. She has also branched into other forms of cartomancy (le
 normand\, playing cards) and is a budding astrologer. They are also an aut
 hor\, cat owner\, local community organizer\, and hobby collector. Speakin
 g of hobby collecting\, her links can be found here. Agreements for partic
 ipation: We are curious\, open\, and respectful – We assume good will\, 
 ask questions\, and allow space for different experiences and points of vi
 ew. We take care of ourselves – We stretch\, take a break\, eat\, mute f
 or a bit\, drink\, use restroom\, connect with a friend\, rest\, call it a
  night\, etc. as needed for our own well-being as individuals. We keep con
 fidentiality – We speak from personal experience and take home learnings
  while taking care not to identify anyone other than oneself. We don’t g
 atekeep - While we keep confidentiality\, we take our learnings back to ou
 r communities and share freely. We use inclusive language – We speak usi
 ng plain language and ask clarifying questions when we aren’t sure what 
 someone means. We make effort to use gender-neutral language as appropriat
 e. We are all here because we want and choose to be here – We are free t
 o leave at any time\, for any reason. We respect each other - Anyone engag
 ing in prejudice towards another group member will be subject to immediate
  removal. ‍
LOCATION:Online\, online
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/tarot-for-grief-and-crisis
X-SOURCE:YOHOMO
END:VEVENT
