BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:aids candlelight vigil
DTSTART:20260623T210000
DTEND:20260623T210000
UID:64c98dada6850f411277304cbfcb4965@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:Toronto’s AIDS Candlelight Vigil will take place on Tuesday\
 , June 23\, 2026\, 9 p.m. at Barbara Hall Park [519 Church St.]. This year
 &#x27\;s theme is “42 Years of Building Community: Legacy\, Love\, and R
 esistance.&quot\; Join us as we celebrate the legacy of every person impac
 ted by HIV/AIDS\, those whose names are engraved on the memorial\, those w
 hose names are yet to reach us\, and those whose stories live on in our he
 arts and our communities. The vigil committee is also seeking performers\,
  spoken word artists\, and musicians to audition to perform at this year
 ’s vigil. Applicants are invited to reflect on the theme through their w
 ork. Auditions will take place online this year. Apply online via the link
  in bio. Please note that the application form is Pride Toronto branded\, 
 but that artist applications for the Pride Toronto festival are closed\, a
 nd this form is just for AIDS Vigil performers. Please submit your auditio
 ns before 11:59 pm on May 30tH using the link in our bio. If you have any 
 questions or barrier to participation\, please message us or email Vanessa
  at VPatterson@The519.org. ‍
LOCATION:Barbara Hall Park\, 519 Church Street
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/aids-candlelight-vigil-3
X-SOURCE:YOHOMO
END:VEVENT
