DESCRIPTION:Dollylujah! It’s Steers &amp\; Queers Night of 1000 Dollys. 
 Join us for drag\, dancing\, burlesque\, live music and worship of all thi
 ngs Dolly. Steers &amp\; Queers Gay Ole Opry is a long running cult queer 
 country and western party Founded in 2006 in the home of country music\, T
 oronto Canada\, S&amp\;Q is a fantasy of a gay honky tonk. Whether featuri
 ng a twenty five person Dolly Parton tribute choir\, showcasing a young Or
 ville Peck or teaching line-dances straight from the Calgary board of educ
 ation phys-ed curriculum\, S&amp\;Q is always creating playful connections
  between queer and country. This is why S&amp\;Q has been attended by sold
  out crowds in Toronto for over 18 years. From time to time we bring our F
 airy Home Companion to cities and small towns across North America. ‍
LOCATION:The Parkdale Hall\, 1605 Queen St W #2
