 ff party June 13 at Ground Control! And this season we have some surprises
 ! For this edition of PGK it’s double DJ deck sets all night! with our f
 eatured guests The Highland Ponies\, sparkle rainbow dust favourites spinn
 ing a diverse spectrum of music that really represents the community. And 
