  her a special guest out of retirement to share the decks. Light stage\, a
 nd project art is also a double effect with resident DUSX’s brilliance a
 gainst the light effects of community stalwart\, Troy Strum and his ever p
 opular gay as fuck\, rainbow light cube. PGK is also partnering with the H
 ot Tease Film Festival (June 4) as the official decomp party for this incr
 edible event. It’s a bold move for a bold party ready to add the kink pr
 ide stamp to this month’s festivities. Early bird tickets are on sale no
 w in limited quantities. Discount codes available for BIPOC\, SWkrs\, Indu
 stry folks and anyone who needs a little bit of a break right now. Send us
  a DM if you are a community member in need! ‍
